"""elden-research: Elden Ring at a locked 60 FPS on the AMD BC-250 (CachyOS).

  ./elden-research              menu
  ./elden-research install      everything, step by step (re-run it to continue where it stopped)
  ./elden-research check        preflight checks only (changes nothing)
  ./elden-research status       what's installed, Steam's settings, the last game session
  ./elden-research oc-test [--pace quick|normal|thorough] [--max 3900]
                                the overclock safety test (again)
  ./elden-research oc on|off    the OC test's pick while the game runs, or stock clocks
  ./elden-research proton       build (or rebuild) the patched Proton
  ./elden-research steam        the Steam steps, and a check that Steam saved them
  ./elden-research bench        benchmark helpers (snapshot / restore / compare)
  ./elden-research uninstall    remove everything this tool installed

Run it as your normal user; it asks for sudo when a step needs root.
"""
