    {green('·')} each core alone at full load: it must hold the clock, with no wrong results
    {green('·')} a game-like load: no wrong results, no hardware errors, CPU below 85 °C
  {f'then a {soak // 60}-minute soak at the pick. ' if soak else ''}The load generator checks every result it computes.

